OL,3,GNEWSATrain cancellations after person
OL,4,Afound on tracks
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services between Stevenage and
OL,7,FLondon have been cancelled or delayed
OL,8,Fafter a person was found on the tracks.
OL,10,FBritish Transport Police has confirmed
OL,11,Fparamedics were called to the scene at
OL,12,FKnebworth railway station at about
OL,13,F10:00 GMT and the person was pronounced
OL,14,Fdead at the scene.
OL,16,FGreat Northern Rail and Thameslink said
OL,17,Fon their websites, all lines between
OL,18,Fthe stations have been closed, adding
OL,19,Fpassengers should expect trains to be
OL,20,Fcancelled, delayed by up to an hour, or
OL,21,Fdiverted via Hertford North.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
